#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="tmdb_movie_9761" tvg-name="Elephants Dream" tvg-logo="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zROtU9TkpZQrOuEaMAp68FOWLK.jpg" tvg-backdrop="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/9bJDwuhza19HQcYA99FeslLYmUm.jpg" tvg-type="movie" tvg-genre="Open & Classic Essentials" tvg-description="Elephants Dream is the story of two strange characters exploring a capricious and seemingly infinite machine. The elder, Proog, acts as a tour-guide and protector, happily showing off the sights and dangers of the machine to his initially curious but increasingly skeptical protege Emo. As their journey unfolds we discover signs that the machine is not all Proog thinks it is, and his guiding takes on a more desperate aspect.  Elephants Dream is a story about communication and fiction, made purposefully open-ended as the world’s first 3D animated “Open movie”. The film itself is released under the Creative Commons license, along with the entirety of the production files used to make it (roughly 7 Gigabytes of data). The software used to make the movie is the free/open source animation suite Blender along with other open source software, thus allowing the movie to be remade, remixed and re-purposed with only a computer and the data on the DVD or download." tvg-year="2006" tvg-cast="Tygo Gernandt, Cas Jansen" tvg-director="Bassam Kurdali" group-title="Open & Classic Essentials",Elephants Dream
https://download.blender.org/demo/movies/Sintel.2010.720p.mkv

#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="tmdb_movie_15856" tvg-name="헌티드 힐" tvg-logo="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5kdFt3piV3w1pG65W9sSToJ7HB.jpg" tvg-backdrop="https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/vzw5733T4PSielVOeq268GdSzhS.jpg" tvg-type="movie" tvg-genre="Open & Classic Essentials" tvg-description="헌티드 힐'이란 귀신들린 집에 프레드릭의 초대로 모인 다섯 명의 사람들. 백만장자인 프레드릭 로렌은 네번째 아내를 위해 유령 파티를 여는데, 자정부터 오전 8시까지 살아남으면 각각 1만 달러의 상금을 받기로 하는 게임을 시작하고..." tvg-year="1959" tvg-cast="Vincent Price, Carol Ohmart, Richard Long, Alan Marshal, Carolyn Craig" tvg-director="윌리엄 캐슬" group-title="Open & Classic Essentials",헌티드 힐
